{"id":"aparentemente","lemma":"aparentemente","pos":"adv","rank":1445,"glosses":["apparently","seemingly"],"ipa":"/apaˌɾenteˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-aparentemente.wav","examples":[{"text":"El lugar está aparentemente desierto.","en":"The place is apparently deserted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804132"},{"text":"Aparentemente, no hay nada que no pueda pasar hoy.","en":"Apparently, there is nothing that cannot happen today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691616"},{"text":"Aparentemente, el autobús está retrasado.","en":"Apparently, the bus is late."},{"text":"Aparentemente ella había sido rica.","en":"She appears to have been rich."},{"text":"El peligro aparentemente ha terminado.","en":"The danger is apparently over."}]}